    "title": "Sunny, slightly windy conditions for first day of October - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Vince Tropea ,\n12 hours ago (Fremont County, WY) – County 10 meteorologist Dave Lipson has shared that today, October 1, will be sunny with southwest winds gusting up to 20-30 mph as the pressure gradient increases due to an incoming trough of low pressure off the Pacific Coast. Mostly clear conditions are expected tonight. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
